  "waivers": {
    "windows": {
      "reason": "A dependency has no Windows build. At fork head 537cdca the port requires hipMM 5.0.0 (commit dccfd94), which does not compile on Windows: rmm/detail/runtime_capabilities.hpp includes dlfcn.h, and rmm/mr/detail/arena.hpp assumes a 64-bit unsigned long (1UL << 40) and pointer-like std::array iterators. Its dependency libhipcxx (90b6a2b) calls the device-only _wassert from host code in the AMD Windows branch of cuda/std/__cccl/assert.h (154 translation units). hipMM 5.0.0 also calls hipMemGetDefaultMemPool, which the TheRock 7.14.0a20260612 Windows wheels on the gfx1151 host do not declare. Evidence: notes.md, Validation 2026-11-17 windows-gfx1151 at 537cdca (171 failed build steps with the documented command). With throwaway local patches to hipMM, libhipcxx and fmt the port's own code passed 309 of 310 tests on Windows, so the obstacle is the dependency, not the port. Linux gfx942, gfx1100 and gfx90a completed at this head. Revisit when hipMM and libhipcxx build on Windows.",
      "suggested_at": "2026-11-17T16:31:21Z",
      "approved_by": "jeffdaily",
      "at": "2026-11-17T16:31:25Z"
    }
  },
